# The build context is the repository root, because the server image copies skillmaster-server/
# from it. (It used to copy gateway/ too; that directory is gone — ADR 0096.) The list below keeps
# caches, the other subprojects and tooling out of the context.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/*.egg-info/
**/.venv/
**/build/
**/target/
.git/
.github/
.claude/
docs/
skillmaster-cli/
# The archived Python baseline is a design reference; nothing at runtime reads it.
skillmaster-server/reference-python/
**/tests/
**/uv.lock
README.md
.gitignore
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
.DS_Store
